<title>USA: Byron Center PS, Mich., won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>Byron Center PS, Mich., won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin, Kubik, Stephens &amp; Thompson, Inc., said it won $5.730 million of Byron Center PS, Mich., general obligation 1997 school building and site bonds with a net interest cost of 5.52 percent.</p>
</text>
